#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`lsm9ds1` --- LSM9DS1 9-axis IMU"
msgstr ":mod:`lsm9ds1` --- IMU de 9 ejes LSM9DS1"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:7
msgid ""
"Driver for the ST LSM9DS1 iNEMO inertial module over I2C. The LSM9DS1 "
"combines a 3-axis accelerometer, 3-axis gyroscope and 3-axis magnetometer in"
" a single package; the accelerometer and gyroscope share an I2C address "
"while the magnetometer responds on a second address. This driver also "
"enables the on-chip 16-deep gyro/accel FIFO so that the most recent samples "
"can be drained efficiently through :meth:`iter_accel_gyro`."
msgstr ""
"Controlador para el módulo inercial iNEMO LSM9DS1 de ST a través de I2C. El "
"LSM9DS1 combina un acelerómetro de 3 ejes, un giroscopio de 3 ejes y un "
"magnetómetro de 3 ejes en un solo encapsulado; el acelerómetro y el "
"giroscopio comparten una dirección I2C, mientras que el magnetómetro "
"responde en una segunda dirección. Este controlador también habilita la FIFO"
" de giroscopio/acelerómetro de 16 niveles del chip para que las muestras más"
" recientes puedan vaciarse eficientemente mediante :meth:`iter_accel_gyro`."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:14
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Ejemplo::"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:29
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Clases"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:33
msgid ""
"Construct an ``LSM9DS1`` instance, verify the WHO_AM_I registers of both "
"sub-devices, configure all three sensors and enable the accel/gyro FIFO in "
"continuous mode."
msgstr ""
"Construye una instancia de ``LSM9DS1``, verifica los registros WHO_AM_I de "
"ambos subdispositivos, configura los tres sensores y habilita la FIFO de "
"acelerómetro/giroscopio en modo continuo."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:37
msgid "``bus``"
msgstr "``bus``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:38
msgid "A configured :py:class:`machine.I2C` bus the sensor is attached to."
msgstr ""
"Un bus :py:class:`machine.I2C` configurado al que está conectado el sensor."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:40
msgid "``address_imu``"
msgstr "``address_imu``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:41
msgid ""
"7-bit I2C address of the accelerometer/gyroscope sub-device. Defaults to "
"``0x6B``."
msgstr ""
"Dirección I2C de 7 bits del subdispositivo acelerómetro/giroscopio. Su valor"
" predeterminado es ``0x6B``."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:44
msgid "``address_magnet``"
msgstr "``address_magnet``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:45
msgid ""
"7-bit I2C address of the magnetometer sub-device. Defaults to ``0x1E``."
msgstr ""
"Dirección I2C de 7 bits del subdispositivo magnetómetro. Su valor "
"predeterminado es ``0x1E``."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:48
msgid "``gyro_odr``"
msgstr "``gyro_odr``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:49
msgid ""
"Gyroscope output data rate in Hz. Must be one of ``0`` (off), ``14.9``, "
"``59.5``, ``119``, ``238``, ``476`` or ``952``."
msgstr ""
"Tasa de datos de salida del giroscopio en Hz. Debe ser uno de ``0`` "
"(apagado), ``14.9``, ``59.5``, ``119``, ``238``, ``476`` o ``952``."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:52
msgid "``gyro_scale``"
msgstr "``gyro_scale``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:53
msgid ""
"Gyroscope full-scale range in degrees-per-second. Must be one of ``245``, "
"``500`` or ``2000``."
msgstr ""
"Rango de escala completa del giroscopio en grados por segundo. Debe ser uno "
"de ``245``, ``500`` o ``2000``."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:56
msgid "``accel_odr``"
msgstr "``accel_odr``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:57
msgid ""
"Accelerometer output data rate in Hz. Same set of values as ``gyro_odr``."
msgstr ""
"Tasa de datos de salida del acelerómetro en Hz. El mismo conjunto de valores"
" que ``gyro_odr``."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:60
msgid "``accel_scale``"
msgstr "``accel_scale``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:61
msgid ""
"Accelerometer full-scale range in g. Must be one of ``2``, ``4``, ``8`` or "
"``16``."
msgstr ""
"Rango de escala completa del acelerómetro en g. Debe ser uno de ``2``, "
"``4``, ``8`` o ``16``."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:64
msgid "``magnet_odr``"
msgstr "``magnet_odr``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:65
msgid ""
"Magnetometer output data rate in Hz. Must be one of ``0.625``, ``1.25``, "
"``2.5``, ``5``, ``10``, ``20``, ``40`` or ``80``."
msgstr ""
"Tasa de datos de salida del magnetómetro en Hz. Debe ser uno de ``0.625``, "
"``1.25``, ``2.5``, ``5``, ``10``, ``20``, ``40`` o ``80``."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:68
msgid "``magnet_scale``"
msgstr "``magnet_scale``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:69
msgid ""
"Magnetometer full-scale range in gauss. Must be one of ``4``, ``8``, ``12`` "
"or ``16``."
msgstr ""
"Rango de escala completa del magnetómetro en gauss. Debe ser uno de ``4``, "
"``8``, ``12`` o ``16``."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:74
msgid ""
"Write a hard-iron offset vector into the magnetometer's ``OFFSET_REG_*_M`` "
"registers. The offset is given in the same units as :meth:`magnet` returns "
"(gauss); each component is converted to raw LSBs using the configured "
"magnetometer scale before being written."
msgstr ""
"Escribe un vector de compensación de hierro duro (hard-iron) en los "
"registros ``OFFSET_REG_*_M`` del magnetómetro. La compensación se da en las "
"mismas unidades que devuelve :meth:`magnet` (gauss); cada componente se "
"convierte a LSB sin procesar usando la escala de magnetómetro configurada "
"antes de escribirse."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:82
msgid ""
"Return the single-byte ``WHO_AM_I`` register value of the "
"accelerometer/gyroscope sub-device."
msgstr ""
"Devuelve el valor de un solo byte del registro ``WHO_AM_I`` del "
"subdispositivo acelerómetro/giroscopio."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:87
msgid ""
"Return the single-byte ``WHO_AM_I`` register value of the magnetometer sub-"
"device."
msgstr ""
"Devuelve el valor de un solo byte del registro ``WHO_AM_I`` del "
"subdispositivo magnetómetro."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:92
msgid "Return the gyroscope vector ``(x, y, z)`` in degrees per second."
msgstr ""
"Devuelve el vector del giroscopio ``(x, y, z)`` en grados por segundo."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:96
msgid ""
"Return the acceleration vector ``(x, y, z)`` in units of standard gravity (1"
" g = 9.81 m/s²)."
msgstr ""
"Devuelve el vector de aceleración ``(x, y, z)`` en unidades de gravedad "
"estándar (1 g = 9.81 m/s²)."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:101
msgid "Return the magnetic-field vector ``(x, y, z)`` in gauss."
msgstr "Devuelve el vector de campo magnético ``(x, y, z)`` en gauss."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:105
msgid ""
"Generator that yields ``(gyro, accel)`` tuples for every sample currently "
"available in the FIFO and stops once the FIFO is empty. Each component "
"vector has the same units as :meth:`gyro` and :meth:`accel` respectively."
msgstr ""
"Generador que produce tuplas ``(gyro, accel)`` por cada muestra actualmente "
"disponible en la FIFO y se detiene una vez que la FIFO está vacía. Cada "
"vector componente tiene las mismas unidades que :meth:`gyro` y :meth:`accel`"
" respectivamente."
